UID:3aba2e2fc786@paris-academique
DTSTAMP:20260601T204400Z
DTSTART:20260604T110000
DTEND:20260604T120000
SUMMARY:Carine Pivoteau : Effective Asymptotics of Combinatorial Systems
DESCRIPTION:In their book Analytic Combinatorics\, Flajolet and Sedgewick describe a general approach that starts from a combinatorial description\, translates this description into equations satisfied by generating functions\, views these generating functions as analytic functions and exploits their singular behavior to deduce asymptotic properties of the combinatorial objects when their size becomes large. Wit\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16684/
LOCATION:IHP - Bâtiment Borel
URL:https://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16684/
END:VEVENT
